{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Island of Bad Women is home to a powerful and dangerous group of women, each more ruthless than the last. Bound together by a shared vision of destruction, they have cast aside all morality and now stand united in their mission to bring about the end of humanity. <br>Your mission is simple but far from easy: infiltrate the island, battle your way through the ranks of these deadly foes, and put an end to their plans before it\u2019s too late. The fate of the world depends on your success.<br>You arrive on the Island of Bad Women riding a powerful, custom engineered bike built for combat and speed. Outfitted with a high impact rocket launcher, your vehicle is more than just transportation it\u2019s a tool of destruction, your lifeline in hostile territory. From the moment you touch down, you'll be met with resistance, forced to fight for every inch of ground as you push deeper into the heart of enemy territory.<br>The game has a massive open world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798250?t=1767063806","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798250?t=1767063806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798250/48cb5f439bcc7161abe3354a0ded51ab2f667341/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767063806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798250/48cb5f439bcc7161abe3354a0ded51ab2f667341/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767063806","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Island of Bad Women is home to a powerful and dangerous group of women, each more ruthless than the last. Bound together by a shared vision of destruction, they have cast aside all morality and now stand united in their mission to bring about the end of humanity. <br>Your mission is simple but far from easy: infiltrate the island, battle your way through the ranks of these deadly foes, and put an end to their plans before it\u2019s too late. The fate of the world depends on your success.<br>You arrive on the Island of Bad Women riding a powerful, custom engineered bike built for combat and speed. Outfitted with a high impact rocket launcher, your vehicle is more than just transportation it\u2019s a tool of destruction, your lifeline in hostile territory. From the moment you touch down, you'll be met with resistance, forced to fight for every inch of ground as you push deeper into the heart of enemy territory.<br>The game has a massive open world.</p>","developers":["123"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798250/b49d858fe734f8cc8e424e93acfdcde9223d4a89/header.jpg?t=1767063806","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3798250/127360585/9e4d8b6f5a87032aa7dd8b6d3a1b694ddf85416c/1754507685/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754508134","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3798250/127360585/9e4d8b6f5a87032aa7dd8b6d3a1b694ddf85416c/1754507685/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754508134","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3798250/127360585/9e4d8b6f5a87032aa7dd8b6d3a1b694ddf85416c/1754507685/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754508134","id":257179349,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257179349/c26986b0a0dba009c4f66ad81f95e4b6d62ad78d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=175450